WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:43.329
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:43.599 --> 01:45.120
Looks like Chen Hai was prepared for this.

3
01:48.799 --> 01:50.640
Contact the Shanxi police.

4
01:50.840 --> 01:52.560
Have them visit Hu Dong's hometown.

5
01:52.879 --> 01:55.159
See if Hu Dong really went back there.

6
01:55.599 --> 01:56.319
I'll get right on it.

7
02:00.400 --> 02:00.840
Captain Lu.

8
02:01.280 --> 02:02.439
Ask him about the drugs.

9
02:05.319 --> 02:06.280
Do you know Qian Feng?

10
02:07.400 --> 02:08.000
Yes.

11
02:08.840 --> 02:09.960
We've even had meals together.

12
02:10.479 --> 02:11.560
Though we're not very close.

13
02:13.039 --> 02:13.560
Not close?

14
02:16.159 --> 02:17.000
You worked together.

15
02:17.800 --> 02:19.039
You must be mistaken.

16
02:19.400 --> 02:21.280
Qian Feng doesn't even work for Longze.

17
02:26.599 --> 02:27.680
Qian Feng is suspected of drug trafficking,

18
02:27.680 --> 02:28.639
and we've already arrested him.

19
02:29.199 --> 02:30.000
According to his confession,

20
02:30.759 --> 02:31.800
you are his supplier.

21
02:33.800 --> 02:34.759
What drug trafficking?

22
02:34.960 --> 02:35.879
What supplier?

23
02:36.919 --> 02:38.639
I have no idea what you're talking about.

24
02:39.639 --> 02:40.319
You don't understand, huh?

25
02:40.560 --> 02:41.680
Then let me say it again.

26
02:41.719 --> 02:44.520
Qian Feng trafficked drugs through Zhongtian Logistics,

27
02:44.960 --> 02:45.840
and according to his statement,

28
02:46.439 --> 02:48.199
you arranged all of it for him.

29
02:53.840 --> 02:56.000
Are you sure Qian Feng was talking about me?

30
02:56.199 --> 02:57.439
I've already made it very clear to you.

31
02:57.439 --> 02:59.240
I barely even know the guy.

32
03:00.520 --> 03:02.520
I've never even seen drugs in my life.

33
03:02.520 --> 03:03.560
How could I traffic drugs?

34
03:07.280 --> 03:09.719
Could he have been coerced into confessing

35
03:12.360 --> 03:13.719
and just framed someone at random?

36
03:16.280 --> 03:16.919
Mr. Chen.

37
03:17.719 --> 03:18.879
Mind your words.

38
03:20.000 --> 03:20.960
What era do you think this is?

39
03:21.360 --> 03:23.400
We handle cases following legal procedures

40
03:23.400 --> 03:24.159
and lawful methods.

41
03:24.840 --> 03:26.039
From the moment you walked in,

42
03:26.240 --> 03:28.080
have we coerced a confession out of you?

43
03:28.080 --> 03:28.560
No, no, no.

44
03:29.639 --> 03:30.520
That's not what I meant.

45
03:30.879 --> 03:31.439
Some people...

46
03:31.439 --> 03:33.360
their mental resilience is rather weak.

47
03:33.960 --> 03:35.639
Maybe your tone during interrogation

48
03:35.759 --> 03:36.759
was slightly too harsh,

49
03:36.960 --> 03:38.919
so he just dragged others down with him.

50
03:43.280 --> 03:44.000
Well,

51
03:45.159 --> 03:46.599
about Qian Feng's arrest,

52
03:49.520 --> 03:50.560
I did hear about it.

53
03:50.919 --> 03:52.360
It's been quite a while now, hasn't it?

54
03:53.520 --> 03:55.199
If you really had any evidence,

55
03:55.199 --> 03:57.919
you wouldn't have waited until today to question me.

56
03:59.479 --> 04:01.800
Ask him about Zhang Xuebin and Guo Yingying.

57
04:02.400 --> 04:04.159
Do you know Zhang Xuebin from Chaoqing,

58
04:04.560 --> 04:06.400
and Guo Yingying from Yike Gifts?

59
04:13.159 --> 04:13.960
Officers,

60
04:14.520 --> 04:15.560
I think you really should

61
04:15.560 --> 04:17.240
talk to my friends and family.

62
04:18.160 --> 04:19.480
My life is very simple,

63
04:19.680 --> 04:21.000
and so is my social circle.

64
04:21.720 --> 04:23.560
Most days, if I'm not at home,

65
04:23.600 --> 04:24.680
I'm at the office.

66
04:25.680 --> 04:27.680
Now you suddenly rattle off these names,

67
04:27.680 --> 04:30.000
asking if I know them or how close we are.

68
04:32.399 --> 04:33.519
Can you just tell me,

69
04:35.360 --> 04:38.319
what exactly do you suspect me of?

70
04:42.560 --> 04:45.279
Zhang Xuebin, Guo Yingying, and Qian Feng

71
04:45.439 --> 04:47.240
trafficked drugs via Zhongtian Logistics.

72
04:48.839 --> 04:50.199
After getting the drugs,

73
04:50.399 --> 04:51.480
they passed them to their downlines.

74
04:52.920 --> 04:54.879
And the one collecting the drug money

75
04:54.879 --> 04:57.279
was the head of security at Longze Group:

76
04:57.480 --> 04:58.000
Hu Dong.

77
04:59.439 --> 05:02.279
You and Hu Dong are colleagues at Longze,

78
05:02.279 --> 05:03.079
and you interact frequently.

79
05:04.199 --> 05:05.600
And Zhou Fuhai from Zhongtian Logistics

80
05:06.079 --> 05:07.319
is your old classmate.

81
05:09.519 --> 05:12.560
Don't you think this is too coincidental?

82
05:16.079 --> 05:17.959
So that's why you're looking for Hu Dong.

83
05:18.279 --> 05:19.920
I already made this clear earlier:

84
05:20.439 --> 05:22.879
Hu Dong and I aren't close.

85
05:23.879 --> 05:25.199
As for interacting frequently,

86
05:25.639 --> 05:27.639
I have no idea what you're talking about.

87
05:29.639 --> 05:32.279
I met Zhou Fuhai in business school.

88
05:32.439 --> 05:33.279
Sure, we were classmates,

89
05:36.279 --> 05:38.279
but that's as far as it goes.

90
05:39.319 --> 05:42.759
As for Zhang Xuebin and this Guo Yingying,

91
05:42.759 --> 05:44.040
whatever connection they have to me,

92
05:45.279 --> 05:46.800
why don't you just ask them directly?

93
05:46.839 --> 05:47.920
They're both dead.

94
05:48.639 --> 05:49.439
Dead?

95
05:51.879 --> 05:52.480
How did they die?

96
05:58.680 --> 06:00.720
You don't suspect me, do you?

97
06:06.120 --> 06:08.079
We believe you probably weren't

98
06:08.519 --> 06:09.680
the one who directly murdered them.

99
06:11.360 --> 06:12.920
What's that supposed to mean?

100
06:14.920 --> 06:16.800
Are you calling me the mastermind?

101
06:18.639 --> 06:19.600
Do you have any evidence?

102
06:23.120 --> 06:24.199
Ever since I walked in here,

103
06:24.360 --> 06:25.759
you've been falsely accusing me.

104
06:26.000 --> 06:27.160
If you have evidence,

105
06:27.519 --> 06:28.759
you can arrest me right now.

106
06:29.240 --> 06:30.279
If you don't,

107
06:30.399 --> 06:32.319
I demand to leave immediately.

108
06:33.480 --> 06:34.160
Mr. Chen,

109
06:34.639 --> 06:36.279
no one here is falsely accusing you.

110
06:36.920 --> 06:38.439
However, we have the authority

111
06:38.720 --> 06:40.439
to hold you in detention for 48 hours.

112
06:40.680 --> 06:41.120
Right.

113
06:42.079 --> 06:43.319
You have the authority,

114
06:43.519 --> 06:45.439
but I also have the right to stay silent.

115
06:55.279 --> 06:56.439
From now on,

116
06:57.319 --> 06:59.680
I refuse to answer any of your questions.

117
06:59.959 --> 07:00.680
I'll say it again:

118
07:01.560 --> 07:03.000
if you have evidence, arrest me.

119
07:09.199 --> 07:09.600
Fine.

120
07:11.839 --> 07:13.079
You're entitled to your rights.

121
07:15.439 --> 07:16.360
But let me tell you this:

122
07:17.199 --> 07:19.720
our people are bringing Zhou Fuhai back.

123
07:21.040 --> 07:22.279
Whatever deals you two had,

124
07:23.160 --> 07:24.120
we'll find out soon enough.

125
07:24.879 --> 07:25.319
Let's go.

126
07:28.160 --> 07:28.959
Sorry for the trouble, gentlemen.

127
08:15.160 --> 08:15.800
What do you think?

128
08:18.240 --> 08:19.199
Judging by what he said,

129
08:19.759 --> 08:20.959
he seems pretty confident.

130
08:22.879 --> 08:24.120
He's very slick.

131
08:24.360 --> 08:25.360
He knows very well

132
08:25.720 --> 08:27.319
we have no direct evidence to arrest him.

133
08:29.560 --> 08:30.360
He's smart,

134
08:31.839 --> 08:35.720
keeping the cash and goods separate.

135
08:36.639 --> 08:38.200
And on the receiving end,

136
08:38.679 --> 08:41.159
neither the statements nor the evidence

137
08:42.120 --> 08:43.200
are sufficient.

138
08:43.320 --> 08:46.399
To prove Chen Hai trafficked drugs,

139
08:46.639 --> 08:48.600
we can only start with Cheng Weimin

140
08:48.799 --> 08:50.320
or Zhou Fuhai.

141
08:51.960 --> 08:53.200
Jiangyang police have already picked up

142
08:53.200 --> 08:54.080
Cheng Weimin's trail.

143
08:54.360 --> 08:55.960
Once his exact whereabouts are confirmed,

144
08:55.960 --> 08:57.039
they'll arrest him immediately.

145
08:57.639 --> 08:58.720
As for Zhongtian Logistics,

146
08:58.960 --> 09:01.080
they let Qian Feng's cargo pass unchecked.

147
09:01.600 --> 09:03.000
There's no way Zhou Fuhai knows nothing.

148
09:06.519 --> 09:07.960
When it comes to Zhongtian Logistics,

149
09:08.200 --> 09:09.120
Li Xiao knows it best.

150
09:09.320 --> 09:10.120
Go with him

151
09:10.919 --> 09:11.960
and bring Zhou Fuhai in.

152
09:12.399 --> 09:12.759
Yes, sir.

153
10:04.720 --> 10:05.399
Hello.

154
10:07.200 --> 10:09.080
Are you looking for Director Zhou?

155
10:09.399 --> 10:09.720
Yes.

156
10:10.080 --> 10:11.120
We're from the Municipal Bureau.

157
10:12.000 --> 10:13.000
We need to speak with Zhou Fuhai.

158
10:13.279 --> 10:13.720
Where is he?

159
10:14.360 --> 10:14.919
Unfortunately,

160
10:15.120 --> 10:16.200
he didn't come in to work today.

161
10:16.559 --> 10:17.279
He didn't come in?

162
10:18.039 --> 10:18.840
Did he say why?

163
10:19.559 --> 10:20.399
No, he didn't.

164
10:21.240 --> 10:22.080
This morning,

165
10:22.080 --> 10:23.360
during an important company meeting,

166
10:23.360 --> 10:24.679
I called him, but he didn't pick up.

167
10:28.399 --> 10:29.080
All right. Thank you.

168
10:29.399 --> 10:30.480
You're welcome. Just doing my job.

169
10:38.960 --> 10:40.480
Chen Hai was acting far too composed today.

170
10:41.279 --> 10:42.759
Something's likely happened to Zhou Fuhai.

171
11:08.120 --> 11:08.759
Look at this.

172
11:09.039 --> 11:11.639
Look, water has soaked through our ceiling.

173
11:12.080 --> 11:13.559
Last night when the water was shut off,

174
11:13.720 --> 11:14.879
they must've left the tap running.

175
11:15.200 --> 11:16.240
I went up and knocked forever,

176
11:16.440 --> 11:17.200
but nobody answered.

177
11:17.720 --> 11:18.960
Let's go check. Let's go take a look.

178
11:26.399 --> 11:27.039
There's so much water!

179
11:33.399 --> 11:34.879
Someone's dead! He's dead!

180
11:34.879 --> 11:36.279
Call the police! Hurry, call the police!

181
11:36.480 --> 11:37.279
We're from the Municipal Bureau.

182
11:37.559 --> 11:38.720
Officers, someone's dead!

183
11:38.720 --> 11:39.879
He hanged himself!

184
11:42.039 --> 11:42.720
Clear the scene.

185
11:43.960 --> 11:44.600
Notify the medical examiner.

186
11:45.240 --> 11:45.600
Evacuate immediately.

187
11:45.600 --> 11:46.679
Hurry, hurry! Move, move, move!

188
11:47.320 --> 11:48.799
When was the last time

189
11:48.799 --> 11:49.480
you met with Hu Dong?

190
11:51.720 --> 11:52.639
I've already told you.

191
11:53.639 --> 11:55.519
I'm not answering any more questions.

192
12:08.960 --> 12:09.320
Captain Bai,

193
12:10.960 --> 12:11.799
Zhou Fuhai is dead.

194
12:30.960 --> 12:31.720
Excuse me, please make way.

195
12:33.679 --> 12:34.720
Captain Bai, please follow me.

196
12:41.840 --> 12:42.200
Captain Bai.

197
12:49.919 --> 12:50.399
Captain Bai.

198
13:11.960 --> 13:12.480
What's the situation?

199
13:15.279 --> 13:15.840
Suicide by hanging.

200
13:18.360 --> 13:19.759
Could this be another cover-up?

201
13:22.600 --> 13:23.799
Judging from the scene,

202
13:24.039 --> 13:24.960
it really does look like suicide.

203
13:26.399 --> 13:27.240
The ligature mark on the neck

204
13:27.240 --> 13:28.600
is the direct cause of death.

205
13:29.519 --> 13:30.559
The facial cyanosis

206
13:30.840 --> 13:32.639
was caused by jugular vein compression.

207
13:33.480 --> 13:35.279
Hyoid bone fracture, tongue protruding,

208
13:35.559 --> 13:36.679
all clear signs of hanging.

209
13:37.320 --> 13:38.399
Still, a definitive conclusion

210
13:38.759 --> 13:40.159
will require a full autopsy.

211
13:44.720 --> 13:46.120
This voice recorder was found at the scene.

212
13:46.759 --> 13:48.480
He probably left it before he died.

213
13:53.320 --> 13:54.759
What's with all the water in the room?

214
13:55.080 --> 13:56.279
The water was shut off here last night.

215
13:57.720 --> 13:59.120
The deceased left his tap open.

216
13:59.399 --> 14:01.000
When water was restored this morning,

217
14:01.000 --> 14:02.679
it flooded outside and a neighbor noticed.

218
14:02.919 --> 14:03.960
They went to property management,

219
14:04.159 --> 14:05.879
who happened to have a spare key.

220
14:06.039 --> 14:07.039
When they opened the door,

221
14:07.879 --> 14:08.799
they found the body.

222
14:10.120 --> 14:10.759
Where's his family?

223
14:11.639 --> 14:12.840
He and his wife are separated.

224
14:13.080 --> 14:14.320
His wife has the kid.

225
14:15.679 --> 14:16.200
Captain,

226
14:16.879 --> 14:17.440
we've got something.

227
14:32.279 --> 14:33.039
Suicide to escape punishment.

228
14:36.480 --> 14:37.799
What I am about to say

229
14:38.919 --> 14:40.240
is my personal confession.

230
14:42.720 --> 14:43.879
In everyone's eyes,

231
14:45.039 --> 14:47.240
I'm an executive at Zhongtian Logistics,

232
14:48.240 --> 14:49.759
with a happy family.

233
14:51.320 --> 14:53.080
But what no one knows

234
14:54.440 --> 14:56.360
is that beneath an ordinary man's mask

235
14:56.919 --> 14:59.039
lies the identity of a criminal.

236
15:01.279 --> 15:02.240
Two years ago,

237
15:03.320 --> 15:05.559
I met drug dealer Cheng Weimin.

238
15:06.039 --> 15:06.960
He told me

239
15:08.360 --> 15:09.799
drug trafficking was fast money.

240
15:10.279 --> 15:12.200
Blinded by greed,

241
15:13.320 --> 15:15.200
I used my position at Zhongtian

242
15:15.679 --> 15:16.879
to traffic drugs with him.

243
15:18.000 --> 15:22.080
In Nanhai, I found Qian Feng, Zhang Xuebin

244
15:22.600 --> 15:24.519
and Guo Yingying as downlines.

245
15:25.200 --> 15:28.159
Cheng Weimin used Zhongtian Logistics

246
15:29.080 --> 15:31.240
to ship drugs to Qian Feng and the others.

247
15:32.679 --> 15:34.559
Although I made a lot of money,

248
15:35.039 --> 15:38.200
my mind was never at peace.

249
15:39.279 --> 15:43.039
Since the police investigated Zhongtian,

250
15:44.240 --> 15:45.240
I realized

251
15:46.639 --> 15:48.240
that I've reached the end of the road.

252
15:49.279 --> 15:50.240
During this time,

253
15:51.080 --> 15:53.080
my conscience has been deeply tormented.

254
15:55.039 --> 15:56.519
I have failed my family

255
15:57.200 --> 15:58.360
and the leaders who trusted me.

256
16:00.480 --> 16:01.600
The wrongs I have done

257
16:02.679 --> 16:04.279
can no longer be undone.

258
16:05.759 --> 16:07.600
I can only use my death

259
16:07.600 --> 16:08.320
to atone for my crimes.

260
16:17.559 --> 16:19.039
This recording from Zhou Fuhai

261
16:19.480 --> 16:22.480
highly contradicts Qian Feng's confession.

262
16:24.919 --> 16:26.200
Yet judging by common sense,

263
16:26.879 --> 16:29.399
what's said in this recording seems genuine.

264
16:29.960 --> 16:31.919
After all, these are words spoken

265
16:32.279 --> 16:33.559
by a man on the verge of death.

266
16:34.720 --> 16:36.519
Could Chen Hai have merely connected

267
16:36.519 --> 16:37.840
Zhou Fuhai with Qian Feng,

268
16:38.120 --> 16:39.200
without being involved in the drug trade?

269
16:40.039 --> 16:40.960
I still believe

270
16:41.360 --> 16:43.320
Qian Feng's confession holds up.

271
16:44.320 --> 16:46.240
Ever since Operation Thunderbolt began,

272
16:46.879 --> 16:49.000
all our leads have centered on Chen Hai.

273
16:49.679 --> 16:52.279
Yet Zhou Fuhai's statement claims

274
16:53.240 --> 16:55.480
that the drug trafficking network

275
16:55.480 --> 16:56.559
was built solely by him and Cheng Weimin.

276
16:57.159 --> 16:59.279
Could the highway arson case,

277
16:59.519 --> 17:00.799
the Qin Hao drug trafficking case,

278
17:01.600 --> 17:02.879
and the Mu Qing drug trafficking case

279
17:03.120 --> 17:05.279
really have nothing to do

280
17:05.440 --> 17:07.039
with Zhongtian Logistics?

281
17:09.480 --> 17:10.440
That's why I think

282
17:10.680 --> 17:11.480
this recording,

283
17:11.960 --> 17:14.160
even if recorded by Zhou Fuhai himself,

284
17:15.000 --> 17:17.079
might still be concealing some truth.

285
17:18.559 --> 17:20.400
Yet in this recording,

286
17:20.400 --> 17:24.440
Zhou explained his ties to Cheng and Qian

287
17:24.720 --> 17:26.000
with total clarity,

288
17:26.160 --> 17:27.119
and it all makes sense.

289
17:28.400 --> 17:29.400
Since it's a confession,

290
17:29.680 --> 17:32.079
he has no reason to omit only Chen Hai.

291
17:35.640 --> 17:38.079
Our previous suspicions of Chen Hai

292
17:38.079 --> 17:39.160
were merely speculation.

293
17:39.519 --> 17:40.960
What we have before us now

294
17:41.039 --> 17:44.000
is a suspect's dying statement.

295
17:47.079 --> 17:48.359
Don't you think this recording

296
17:48.359 --> 17:49.599
sounds a bit off?

297
17:50.079 --> 17:51.640
Though I can't quite put my finger on it.

298
17:52.400 --> 17:53.559
Just as you said, Captain Lu,

299
17:54.880 --> 17:55.799
in this recording of his,

300
17:55.799 --> 17:57.720
the only one he omitted is Chen Hai.

301
17:58.359 --> 17:59.720
Yet precisely because he was omitted,

302
17:59.720 --> 18:00.799
I feel that Chen Hai

303
18:01.200 --> 18:02.359
might actually be the one

304
18:02.359 --> 18:03.640
who stands to gain the most.

305
18:05.400 --> 18:06.839
But the evidence is right in front of us.

306
18:07.079 --> 18:08.359
We can't let speculation

307
18:08.599 --> 18:09.519
drive our investigation.

308
18:10.119 --> 18:11.599
Unless new evidence overturns it,

309
18:12.680 --> 18:14.880
we will provisionally conclude

310
18:16.200 --> 18:19.359
that Zhou Fuhai ran the Zhongtian ring.

311
18:27.759 --> 18:28.599
So what do we do now?

312
18:29.559 --> 18:30.279
Let Chen Hai go?

313
18:31.279 --> 18:31.920
We don't.

314
18:35.359 --> 18:36.279
This recording

315
18:37.480 --> 18:40.400
only clears his ties to Zhongtian.

316
18:40.960 --> 18:42.119
It doesn't prove

317
18:42.319 --> 18:44.240
whether he's tied to Four-Legged Snake,

318
18:44.240 --> 18:46.119
Li Qiang, and Hu Dong.

319
18:49.480 --> 18:50.759
Then we hold him for 48 hours.

320
18:51.119 --> 18:52.559
And within these 48 hours,

321
18:52.559 --> 18:53.759
we have three things to do.

322
18:54.440 --> 18:56.119
First, find Hu Dong.

323
18:56.640 --> 18:59.119
Second, confirm that Chen Hai and Hu Dong

324
18:59.160 --> 19:00.079
have a direct connection.

325
19:00.359 --> 19:01.039
Third,

326
19:01.480 --> 19:02.400
confirm that Hu Dong

327
19:02.559 --> 19:04.599
is the killer in the Dongshan Park murder.

328
19:06.559 --> 19:07.359
Contact Forensics.

329
19:07.359 --> 19:08.559
Have them rush

330
19:09.079 --> 19:10.319
the Dongshan Park murder case's

331
19:10.319 --> 19:11.200
DNA report,

332
19:11.799 --> 19:13.559
and compare it against Longze Group's

333
19:14.119 --> 19:15.400
security team's DNA profiles.

334
19:15.400 --> 19:17.319
Got it. I'll have them rush the results.

335
19:22.440 --> 19:22.960
Captain Shen.

336
19:26.480 --> 19:27.559
Right. Understood.

337
19:30.640 --> 19:31.759
Word just came from the hospital.

338
19:31.920 --> 19:33.319
Of the suspects from yesterday noon,

339
19:33.400 --> 19:35.680
two died while being resuscitated.

340
19:36.359 --> 19:37.759
Liang Wenbiao is still in a coma.

341
19:38.000 --> 19:39.400
Mai Wendi had the lightest injuries

342
19:39.640 --> 19:40.279
and has regained consciousness.

343
19:41.640 --> 19:41.960
Li Xiao.

344
19:45.279 --> 19:46.400
Li Qiang is extremely vengeful.

345
19:46.599 --> 19:48.160
Liang Wenbiao teamed up with others

346
19:48.160 --> 19:49.079
to kill him this time.

347
19:49.559 --> 19:50.920
He will definitely seek revenge.

348
19:51.680 --> 19:52.160
Guan Qiang.

349
19:52.279 --> 19:53.359
Go take the statement with Li Xiao.

350
19:53.680 --> 19:55.559
And remind the criminal squad officers

351
19:55.920 --> 19:57.839
to keep the suspects protected at all times.

352
19:58.319 --> 19:58.680
Yes, sir.

353
20:05.960 --> 20:06.480
Captain Bai.

354
20:07.599 --> 20:08.720
I know what you're worried about.

355
20:09.279 --> 20:10.880
But we have to trust our colleagues.

356
20:11.200 --> 20:11.880
He can handle it.

357
20:17.960 --> 20:18.839
Those fugitives

358
20:19.480 --> 20:21.200
are extremely dangerous individuals.

359
20:21.960 --> 20:23.720
They are very likely to come back

360
20:23.720 --> 20:24.839
to rescue their accomplices,

361
20:26.160 --> 20:27.640
or even silence them.

362
20:28.559 --> 20:30.400
So you must stay on high alert.

363
20:31.240 --> 20:32.519
Yes, understood.

364
20:34.799 --> 20:35.119
Captain Shen.

365
20:37.799 --> 20:38.640
How is the suspect?

366
20:40.000 --> 20:41.279
Mai Wendi is awake,

367
20:41.839 --> 20:43.119
but the doctor did mention

368
20:43.480 --> 20:44.880
he can't take any stress right now.

369
20:46.960 --> 20:47.720
Go ahead in.

370
21:20.640 --> 21:23.079
Ma Jingrong and you brothers,

371
21:23.559 --> 21:24.759
along with Chen Hai from Longze Group,

372
21:24.759 --> 21:27.039
established a drug network in Nanhai.

373
21:28.720 --> 21:30.839
Ma Jingrong brought in downstream dealers,

374
21:31.640 --> 21:34.119
while Chen Hai collected the drug money

375
21:34.119 --> 21:34.920
and laundered it illegally.

376
21:36.160 --> 21:37.599
But once Qin Hao and Wu Liang

377
21:37.599 --> 21:39.160
were arrested by our police,

378
21:39.480 --> 21:42.599
you lost your foothold in Nanhai.

379
21:43.440 --> 21:45.599
The syndicate behind you even

380
21:46.079 --> 21:47.440
brought in Four-Legged Snake's crew

381
21:47.440 --> 21:48.680
to wipe you all out.

382
21:48.720 --> 21:49.400
Even after that,

383
21:50.240 --> 21:51.640
do you still want to keep their secrets?

384
21:52.319 --> 21:53.559
Nothing you say will change anything.

385
21:54.400 --> 21:55.759
I'll never help you cops.

386
21:56.039 --> 21:56.880
If it weren't for us cops,

387
21:56.880 --> 21:58.039
you would already be dead.

388
22:00.400 --> 22:01.799
Keeping me alive a few extra days

389
22:02.000 --> 22:03.680
is just so I'll rat out my brothers.

390
22:03.680 --> 22:04.599
We saved you

391
22:04.599 --> 22:05.759
so that more people could live.

392
22:06.440 --> 22:07.720
All the drugs you pushed over the years...

393
22:07.839 --> 22:08.759
Do you know how many lives they destroyed?

394
22:09.519 --> 22:10.799
Don't you feel any guilt at all?

395
22:13.720 --> 22:14.039
Fine.

396
22:17.079 --> 22:17.440
Fine.

397
22:18.960 --> 22:19.680
Let's talk about your brothers.

398
22:19.920 --> 22:20.680
That Li Qiang.

399
22:21.759 --> 22:22.920
Don't you know what kind of man he is?

400
22:25.160 --> 22:26.119
If he really saw you as a brother,

401
22:26.119 --> 22:27.440
would he just watch you get arrested?

402
22:30.960 --> 22:31.559
Let me tell you.

403
22:33.000 --> 22:34.519
He doesn't care about loyalty at all,

404
22:34.519 --> 22:35.359
only hatred.

405
22:39.480 --> 22:40.559
Wasn't Wu Liang your brother, too?

406
22:43.400 --> 22:44.440
After Wu Liang went down,

407
22:45.920 --> 22:47.240
didn't Ma Jingrong immediately

408
22:47.240 --> 22:48.200
send people to kill him?

409
22:52.359 --> 22:54.799
This brotherhood you hold so dear,

410
22:55.359 --> 22:56.480
in a moment of crisis,

411
22:57.160 --> 22:58.400
won't just fail to save you,

412
22:58.960 --> 23:01.000
it'll drag you straight into the abyss.

413
23:12.839 --> 23:14.000
Your boss, Ma Jingrong,

414
23:15.119 --> 23:17.039
has been arrested by Country M's police.

415
23:18.119 --> 23:19.240
Your brother, Xiao Yunfei,

416
23:20.680 --> 23:21.960
was also shot dead by the police.

417
23:23.039 --> 23:25.599
Whether it's you or Li Qiang,

418
23:26.680 --> 23:28.720
you've both reached the end of the line.

419
23:39.160 --> 23:41.839
In whatever time you have left,

420
23:42.359 --> 23:44.319
why don't you think about your family?

421
23:46.160 --> 23:46.880
I don't have a family.

422
23:47.640 --> 23:48.000
No.

423
23:49.720 --> 23:50.720
You have a mother.

424
23:51.039 --> 23:52.240
My mom's long dead.

425
23:53.279 --> 23:54.200
When you were eight,

426
23:55.519 --> 23:56.440
your father passed away,

427
23:57.279 --> 23:58.599
your mother ran away from home,

428
24:00.759 --> 24:02.279
and your grandmother raised you.

429
24:02.599 --> 24:04.119
You've never seen her since.

430
24:04.599 --> 24:05.759
But let me tell you,

431
24:06.839 --> 24:08.000
we've already found

432
24:08.000 --> 24:09.160
where your mother is.

433
24:09.559 --> 24:11.160
Don't you want to see her again,

434
24:12.599 --> 24:13.839
to ask her to her face

435
24:15.640 --> 24:17.920
why she abandoned you back then?

436
24:44.200 --> 24:45.319
Hold on.

437
24:51.720 --> 24:52.720
The unfinished building in Xinqiao.

438
25:49.039 --> 25:49.440
Search.

439
26:36.720 --> 26:37.200
Li Xiao!

440
26:58.599 --> 26:59.160
Stay back!

441
27:04.400 --> 27:05.359
I've stepped on a bomb!

442
27:21.200 --> 27:22.720
Quick, call the bomb squad!

443
27:22.799 --> 27:23.240
Yes, sir!

444
27:36.759 --> 27:37.400
Where are you taking me?

445
27:38.160 --> 27:38.960
Away from here.

446
27:41.519 --> 27:42.000
Away?

447
27:45.559 --> 27:46.319
I'm not going with you.

448
27:47.359 --> 27:48.079
Let me go!

449
27:51.880 --> 27:52.920
I told you to stop the car!

450
28:02.880 --> 28:03.599
If you want to leave,

451
28:04.799 --> 28:05.440
go right ahead.

452
28:12.880 --> 28:13.960
But let me remind you,

453
28:14.039 --> 28:15.079
what I can't have,

454
28:15.079 --> 28:16.240
no one else gets either.

455
28:18.039 --> 28:19.000
The moment you step out of this car,

456
28:19.720 --> 28:21.079
I guarantee you

457
28:21.079 --> 28:23.440
you'll never see your cop boyfriend again.

458
28:35.759 --> 28:36.519
What are you doing?

459
28:41.359 --> 28:42.400
Why are you doing this?

460
28:43.200 --> 28:44.759
Why are you doing this to us?

461
28:45.640 --> 28:47.200
Because he owes my brother a life.

462
28:48.720 --> 28:50.599
I let him off easy by not killing him.

463
28:53.039 --> 28:53.839
In this world,

464
28:53.839 --> 28:56.079
everything comes at a price.

465
28:56.880 --> 28:58.720
I won't just watch the woman I love

466
28:58.720 --> 29:00.000
go back to him

467
29:00.480 --> 29:02.480
and live happily with him.

468
29:02.839 --> 29:04.119
You asked me earlier

469
29:05.880 --> 29:08.160
if I kidnapped you out of jealousy.

470
29:11.799 --> 29:13.559
I thought about it,

471
29:15.279 --> 29:16.160
and you were right.

472
29:18.160 --> 29:19.599
He made me lose everything,

473
29:20.880 --> 29:22.480
and I took his woman.

474
29:24.079 --> 29:25.359
It's only fair.

475
30:42.759 --> 30:43.359
Under the bed.

476
30:50.079 --> 30:51.680
Captain Lu, get the men out first.

477
30:52.799 --> 30:53.680
You guys pull out first.

478
30:54.279 --> 30:54.960
I'll stay with him.

479
30:55.200 --> 30:55.680
Yes, sir.

480
30:56.359 --> 30:56.920
Captain Lu...

481
30:58.039 --> 30:58.839
You evacuate first.

482
31:01.279 --> 31:01.839
Don't worry.

483
31:06.079 --> 31:06.440
All right.

484
31:08.559 --> 31:09.200
I'll be waiting for you.

485
31:38.200 --> 31:39.240
Lift the bed.

486
31:51.599 --> 31:53.039
This is an encrypted touch-sensitive bomb.

487
31:53.720 --> 31:55.519
The first touch triggered the timer.

488
31:55.839 --> 31:57.559
Touching it again will detonate it.

489
31:58.039 --> 31:58.920
So right now,

490
31:59.599 --> 32:00.559
you must not move at all.

491
32:01.240 --> 32:02.880
Even slightly moving a toe

492
32:02.920 --> 32:03.920
will detonate the bomb.

493
32:06.799 --> 32:08.720
There's less than five minutes left.

494
32:09.160 --> 32:10.839
We must crack the code immediately.

495
32:11.000 --> 32:12.480
How long will it take to crack the code?

496
32:12.960 --> 32:13.640
Three minutes.

497
32:14.319 --> 32:15.279
But I'm not sure.

498
32:15.799 --> 32:17.000
Quick, sandbag barrier!

499
32:41.960 --> 32:43.799
Hold on. You're going to be okay.

500
33:24.480 --> 33:25.319
Just let me go.

501
33:26.799 --> 33:28.039
I won't see him again.

502
33:29.000 --> 33:29.759
I swear.

503
33:32.240 --> 33:33.559
I'll never see him again.

504
33:35.119 --> 33:36.160
If you just let me go.

505
33:37.640 --> 33:38.559
I'm begging you.

506
33:39.880 --> 33:41.559
Please, just let me go, okay?

507
33:41.960 --> 33:43.720
I made it very clear before.

508
33:44.799 --> 33:46.240
If you leave me,

509
33:46.960 --> 33:49.000
you'll never see him again in this life.

510
33:49.680 --> 33:51.039
Then what's the difference

511
33:51.039 --> 33:51.960
between what you said and what I said?

512
33:51.960 --> 33:53.680
Why?

513
33:58.200 --> 33:58.960
Why?

514
33:59.799 --> 34:01.079
Why take what happened to you

515
34:01.079 --> 34:02.440
and inflict it on us?

516
34:02.720 --> 34:03.759
I'm a drug dealer.

517
34:04.200 --> 34:05.279
He's a cop.

518
34:05.960 --> 34:07.440
We're destined to be mortal enemies.

519
34:08.360 --> 34:09.440
I'll give you one minute.

520
34:10.719 --> 34:12.400
Think it over carefully.

521
34:13.519 --> 34:14.320
Do you want to leave or not?

522
34:59.920 --> 35:01.199
The timer is paused for now,

523
35:02.360 --> 35:03.920
but the trigger mechanism is underneath.

524
35:04.440 --> 35:05.639
I'm not sure if disabling the trigger

525
35:05.639 --> 35:07.559
will restart the timer.

526
35:08.159 --> 35:09.440
Now, I'll count down from three.

527
35:09.679 --> 35:10.559
On the last count,

528
35:10.800 --> 35:11.760
start running out.

529
35:31.480 --> 35:31.960
Three.

530
35:32.480 --> 35:33.199
Two.

531
35:34.920 --> 35:35.639
One.

532
35:38.840 --> 35:39.800
Run!

533
35:53.880 --> 35:54.719
Help him, hurry!

534
36:03.360 --> 36:04.000
Li Xiao!

535
36:08.199 --> 36:09.679
Li Xiao, wake up! Li Xiao!

536
36:10.079 --> 36:10.599
Li Xiao!

537
36:11.519 --> 36:12.039
Li Xiao!

538
36:16.480 --> 36:17.480
Li Xiao, can you hear me?

539
36:20.480 --> 36:22.159
Li Qiang is still on the run.

540
36:23.360 --> 36:24.039
Find him.

541
36:25.440 --> 36:26.360
Find Tian Xin.

542
36:29.159 --> 36:29.679
Li Xiao!

543
36:32.079 --> 36:32.519
Li Xiao!

544
36:33.800 --> 36:34.360
Li Xiao!

545
36:35.800 --> 36:36.519
Li Xiao!

546
36:51.519 --> 36:52.559
If I go with you,

547
36:54.760 --> 36:55.800
will you let him go?

548
37:26.000 --> 37:26.480
Come on out.

549
38:06.239 --> 38:08.199
I spent a fortune

550
38:09.199 --> 38:11.119
to finally get you and that Ma guy

551
38:11.119 --> 38:12.440
out of that place.

552
38:12.719 --> 38:14.800
Aren't you going to reimburse me

553
38:16.039 --> 38:16.480
for this?

554
38:17.920 --> 38:19.000
Don't think I don't know.

555
38:19.440 --> 38:20.400
Every cent you spent

556
38:20.920 --> 38:23.039
will be reimbursed by Officer Mai.

557
38:24.199 --> 38:24.559
Come on.

558
38:25.800 --> 38:27.159
I bailed you out.

559
38:27.519 --> 38:29.440
Shouldn't you show some gratitude?

560
38:31.480 --> 38:32.400
If you want money,

561
38:33.800 --> 38:35.000
ask him—Ma Jingrong.

562
38:35.440 --> 38:36.000
He's got the cash.

563
38:39.440 --> 38:39.800
By the way,

564
38:41.559 --> 38:43.119
were you doing that on purpose last time?

565
38:46.239 --> 38:48.920
When Kano was about to attack you,

566
38:49.199 --> 38:51.400
you pretended not to notice.

567
38:51.679 --> 38:52.920
Did you already anticipate

568
38:53.079 --> 38:55.440
that Ma Jingrong would step in to help?

569
38:55.760 --> 38:56.639
He saved me,

570
38:57.159 --> 38:58.599
so I became devoted to him.

571
38:59.239 --> 39:00.440
It's only natural.

572
39:01.920 --> 39:03.440
I was wondering about that.

573
39:03.559 --> 39:05.960
Turns out you had it planned all along.

574
39:06.400 --> 39:09.440
What was that phrase you mentioned before?

575
39:10.280 --> 39:12.400
Playing...

576
39:12.599 --> 39:13.679
Playing hard to get.

577
39:14.280 --> 39:16.199
Right, playing hard to get.

578
39:18.840 --> 39:19.480
Big Brother is here.

579
39:43.920 --> 39:45.840
How are you? Feeling any better?

580
39:47.280 --> 39:48.960
Almost died.

581
39:50.599 --> 39:51.599
If you stay in here,

582
39:51.760 --> 39:52.800
you're gonna die sooner or later.

583
39:53.480 --> 39:53.880
Well...

584
39:56.159 --> 39:57.800
you don't really expect us

585
39:58.159 --> 39:59.480
to break out with you, do you?

586
40:02.280 --> 40:02.800
Why?

587
40:03.400 --> 40:04.440
Don't tell me the two of you

588
40:04.440 --> 40:06.000
actually want to stay in this hellhole?

589
40:08.239 --> 40:10.400
If you're innocent in the relic heist,

590
40:10.599 --> 40:12.960
the Hirano police will let you go eventually.

591
40:13.559 --> 40:14.960
But if you stir up trouble like this

592
40:14.960 --> 40:15.519
and try to break out,

593
40:16.320 --> 40:17.599
it's a dead end.

594
40:18.159 --> 40:19.079
I can't imagine

595
40:19.079 --> 40:20.920
what your reason is for doing this.

596
40:22.320 --> 40:23.159
Truth be told,

597
40:23.519 --> 40:24.760
I made a deal

598
40:25.679 --> 40:27.119
with a certain man.

599
40:27.840 --> 40:29.480
If I break that deal,

600
40:30.559 --> 40:32.320
I'll never see my wife again.

601
40:33.559 --> 40:34.360
Boss Ma,

602
40:35.440 --> 40:37.599
you're Chinese.

603
40:38.599 --> 40:42.280
Who would you make a deal with in Country M?

604
40:44.320 --> 40:49.280
I move goods between China and Country M.

605
40:50.840 --> 40:52.960
I took in a shipment

606
40:52.960 --> 40:54.599
from a guy named Jiang Liye.

607
40:56.119 --> 40:57.280
And this Jiang Liye,

608
40:58.400 --> 40:59.320
fearing I'd back out,

609
40:59.480 --> 41:02.079
held my wife hostage to keep me in check.

610
41:02.559 --> 41:03.199
In the end,

611
41:04.119 --> 41:06.199
I got caught before offloading the goods.

612
41:07.719 --> 41:08.360
So,

613
41:09.039 --> 41:10.880
if I don't get out of here soon,

614
41:13.880 --> 41:16.039
I really will never see my wife again.

615
41:18.119 --> 41:19.480
Jiang Liye...

616
41:21.960 --> 41:23.440
Boss Ma, last time you told me

617
41:23.679 --> 41:25.519
to contact someone on the outside.

618
41:25.679 --> 41:26.280
Right.

619
41:26.719 --> 41:28.480
I was hoping your guy

620
41:28.480 --> 41:29.840
could get word to Jiang Liye.

621
41:30.079 --> 41:31.360
If I get out of here,

622
41:31.760 --> 41:33.960
I'll pay him back as fast as I can.

623
41:34.039 --> 41:35.519
If I die in here,

624
41:35.920 --> 41:37.480
he won't get a damn thing.

625
41:38.760 --> 41:40.199
No, but wait...

626
41:41.639 --> 41:43.079
You said some of your money

627
41:43.079 --> 41:44.519
is with your wife.

628
41:45.079 --> 41:47.159
Then Jiang Liye could just

629
41:47.559 --> 41:48.920
take the money straight from her.

630
41:51.239 --> 41:52.360
In this world,

631
41:53.639 --> 41:56.719
no one can force my wife

632
41:56.719 --> 41:58.320
to do anything she doesn't want to.

633
42:04.039 --> 42:04.559
So,

634
42:06.159 --> 42:06.920
have you decided?

635
42:08.719 --> 42:10.039
Do you want to come with me

636
42:11.440 --> 42:13.360
and live the high life?

637
42:14.719 --> 42:15.840
You saved my life.

638
42:16.559 --> 42:17.639
I should stand by you.

639
42:22.119 --> 42:23.440
If my brother's in,

640
42:23.440 --> 42:24.920
count me in too.

641
42:24.960 --> 42:25.960
Only...

642
42:27.320 --> 42:29.159
if it's not too much trouble,

643
42:29.360 --> 42:32.559
a little extra incentive

644
42:33.199 --> 42:34.920
would make it even sweeter.

645
42:35.440 --> 42:36.159
At the very least,

646
42:37.079 --> 42:38.599
whenever you want some,

647
42:39.000 --> 42:40.320
you won't be out of supply.

648
42:46.960 --> 42:47.880
Since we're leaving,

649
42:48.079 --> 42:49.239
let's get a plan together fast.

650
42:57.480 --> 42:59.760
Tony had someone smuggle word out of prison.

651
43:01.039 --> 43:03.000
Zhuang Yan has gained Ma Jingrong's trust.

652
43:04.119 --> 43:05.360
Ma Jingrong took the initiative

653
43:05.880 --> 43:07.000
to break out together with Zhuang Yan.

654
43:09.480 --> 43:10.880
So what do we need to do now?

655
43:12.880 --> 43:13.880
A prison break...

656
43:14.119 --> 43:16.519
That needs approval from Country M police.

657
43:19.880 --> 43:22.239
Then we'll play it for real.
